msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"Check this box to consider %1 a part of your regular weekly schedule. Any %1"
" daily hours will be shown with different colors than times outside your "
"regular schedule. Check this box if %1 is included as part of your regular "
"weekly schedule (even if you don't work). Typically, weekend days should be "
"unchecked."
