"در محدودهٔ تاریخ مشخص‌شده باشد، یا اصلاً تاریخ شروع و پایانی ندارند."

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, includeUndatedTodos)
#: ui/searchdialog_base.ui:312
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Check this box to search for to-dos that have a start date, due date, or "
"completion date in the date range specified, or have neither a start date "
"nor an end date.  If the box is unchecked, only to-dos that have a due date "
"in the date range will be displayed."
